 "description": "BIGVILLE R17 (block 265000) -- the negative spiral, REACHABLE + ENDOGENOUS. The four outcome rules apply each chosen action's material consequence (work -> income up + slight relief; withdraw -> income down; drink -> income down + wellbeing down; snap -> income down + wellbeing down + conflict up -> R15 violence), and af_hardship_grief closes the loop: coin below a floor raises grief_distress. grief -> worse decision -> worse outcome -> more grief (the R3 collapse-spiral at the affective level). It FALLS OUT of the coupling -- nothing scripts it; ablate affect_gain -> work every period -> no spiral. NO reward/punishment token (income/wellbeing are STATES). Composes existing Terms only; ZERO new Rust.",
